From e7d5928d8a19704d2531a05f00a5f69a2b1c0c3d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 08:01:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/11] lax/regular-combinators: proofs build at v4.33.0
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Twelve enum Fintype instances via derive_fintype% (deriving Fintype on a
nullary-constructor inductive fails at this pin), rewrites over
(Ty.list A).Elt given their arguments or run through a plain-list
'have key : ∀ m : List _.Elt' and instantiated, rfl after simp where
Sum.elim no longer iota-reduces at a def-wrapped type, List.map_map with
its list pinned in the bridge. No statement changed. The concepts fix
(Sym8) is held uncommitted, awaiting Jan.
